    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 52 is a bright one-bedroom apartment located in Rathmines Town Centre, a mature and well-established gated development in a prime central setting. The property enjoys a private east-facing balcony which overlooks the communal gardens and offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, spacious living/dining room with feature fireplace and access to the balcony, separate kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom.\r\n\r\nRathmines is one of Dublin's most established and desirable residential locations with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and leisure facilities all within easy walking distance, including the Swan Shopping Centre and Omniplex Cinema. Dublin City Centre is also within easy reach and the area is exceptionally well served by public transport links. The property represents an excellent opportunity for both owner-occupiers and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall 2.72m x 1.31m With wooden flooring and storage cupboard.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room 4.29m x 3.31m Bright and spacious living/dining room with wooden flooring, feature fireplace and sliding door to private east-facing balcony overlooking the communal gardens.\r\n\r\nKitchen 2.78m x 1.80m Fitted with a range of wall and floor units, tiled splashback, tiled floor and plumbed for a washer/dryer.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3.67m x 2.58m Double bedroom with wooden flooring and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.0m x 1.67m Partly tiled suite comprising bath with electric shower, WHB and WC. Hot press providing additional storage.\r\n\r\nBalcony Private east-facing balcony overlooking the communal gardens.\r\n\r\nOutside Attractive landscaped communal grounds with mature planting.\r\n\r\nIn the centre of the village and opposite the Leisure Centre. Meeting point for viewings is at the Parker Hill entrance, beside car park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Private east-facing balcony overlooking communal gardens\r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation\r\nDouble glazed windows throughout\r\nMature and sought-after gated development\r\nExcellent local amenities and public transport links\r\nNot subject to RPZ restrictions\r\nHighly convenient residential location\r\nService charge: €1,250 per annum"
      },
